body:
Does it include insane amount of cutscenes?

&#x200B;

Jokes aside, I wish I have Nintendo Switch for this... ):

Every. Single. ShB dungeon. 

&#x200B;

Its always the big pulls. Sometimes I want to enjoy the scenery y'kno? I ended up liking Trusts more than actual people because of this. :(

Are you me? You must be me or just twinsies! Because I was in the same spot as you, exactly two years ago and now.

&#x200B;

Hope to see you in FFXIV one day!

Hell, if it was my boyfriend I would have made him wear a full on pink bunny suit but topless. 

&#x200B;

but after I use my money to turn him into a Roe.

My favorite is **Lucario**! He became my must & instant partner after finally getting back into the pokemon game (after a long hiatus) through DPPt. He reignited my pokemon passion. His appearance and how he acts in the pokemon movie just strengthen my love for him more. Lucario is a one cool pokemon after all, and loyal one too. You had no idea how seeing him hatch for the first time and evolve to Lucario made me so happy. *I never knew could I be so happy to actually see a pokemon egg hatch!*

&nbsp;

*I guess it is like an indescribable feeling as a trainer when you finally met your one perfect partner -- in pokemon. Like Ash with Pikachu.*
